# .gitkeep — evaluation/images/ directory
#
# Place 30–50 authentic artisan/craft images here for evaluation.
# Supported formats: JPG, JPEG, PNG, WEBP
#
# Image sourcing rules:
# - Use only images your team owns OR images with a Creative Commons
#   license that permits use (CC0, CC-BY, CC-BY-SA).
# - DO NOT use copyrighted stock photos.
# - Document each image's source in evaluation/metadata.csv.
#
# Images are excluded from Git (.gitignore) to avoid committing large
# binary files and to protect any licensed material.
# Team members must add images locally before running evaluate_vision.py.
